<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Exercício 1 - Bresenham</title>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: #222;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    canvas {
      border: 1px solid #777;
      image-rendering: pixelated;
      cursor: crosshair;
    }

    p {
      margin: 10px 0 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <h2>Exercício 1 - Reta com Algoritmo de Bresenham</h2>

  <canvas id="canvas" width="700" height="700">
    Seu navegador não suporta canvas.
  </canvas>

  <p>
    Clique duas vezes com o botão esquerdo para definir a reta.<br>
    Teclas 0-9: alterar a cor.
  </p>

  <script src="exercicio1.js"></script>

</body>
</html>
